{"id":"vod_bf_26269","vodId":"26269","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"强风吹拂2018","name_cn":"强风吹拂2018","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-27/7bf3ea3d4bea54430cf6bc66690272c2.jpg"},"summary":"藏原走（大冢刚央 配音）是一名性格非常内向的大学一年级男生，不善言辞的他总是习惯用跑步来抒发内心里的情感波动。一天深夜，正在跑步的阿走遇见了名叫清濑灰二（丰永利行 配音）的男子，这个散发着独特魅力的男人主动向阿走搭话，并且向阿走介绍了他所居住的名为竹青庄的公寓。　　就这样，阿走在半推半就之下成为了竹青庄的第10名住户。虽然日常打打闹闹但相互非常信赖的城太郎兄弟、被称之为神童，但阿走却觉得他有些古怪的杉山高志（内山昂辉 配音）、热衷于看电视猜谜节目的坂口洋平（北泽力 配音）、性格轻浮却异常讨厌烟味的高材生岩仓雪彦（兴津和幸 配音），和阿走共享着这幢破旧的公寓的，是这些性格稀奇古怪的人们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 04:17:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":23,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qiangfengchuifu2018/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qiangfengchuifu2018/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qiangfengchuifu2018/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qiangfengchuifu2018/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qiangfengchuifu2018/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qiangfengchuifu2018/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qiangfengchuifu2018/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qiangfengchuifu2018/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qiangfengchuifu2018/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qiangfengchuifu2018/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qiangfengchuifu2018/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qiangfengchuifu2018/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qiangfengchuifu2018/第13集/index.m3u8"},{